  * Timesheet entry functionality
  * Timesheet listing and history view
  * Timesheet submission capabilities
  * Responsive layout using stickers grid system
  * Integration with various UI components for rich user experience
  * CLI utility functions for waybar integration
  * Future workspace automation integration

Technology Stack:
- Go with Bubbletea framework for TUI development
- ntcharts for data visualization
